{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Lane f041, paused 2026-10-20 16:10 PDT. State and resume steps.\n\nImplemented (not yet claimed; the claim gate needs the LLM): the full plan. STORE_ROUTES plus the top-level `store` route; `_execute.execute(..., routes=)`; `_store_commands.store_cli` and the `advanced/store.py` parser; `store` in `_NESTED_INTERCEPTS`; the footprint mount carve-out; `build_compact_one` and the help-facing `build_compact`; `compact_dispatch_cli`; 9 `_REMOVED_SPELLINGS` entries; compact-sweep.yml running `rebar store compact --all`. In-source strings, current docs, README, AGENTS.md and examples/mcp-clients are rewritten, help and cli-reference regenerated, the exit-codes rows updated, and the test call sites retargeted. New tests/unit/test_store_family.py.\n\nPushed: Gerrit 3055, patch set 2, revision 7c426ddd71a0ad2382190e08b9120150d6e1e904, still WIP (hashtag rebar-session-lane-e045), on origin/main c0cf1022671. Patch set 2 amends patch set 1 (914beb802036) with 3 one-line test fixes for the CI failures recorded above: the `_NESTED_INTERCEPTS` pin in test_create_help_no_write_b8de.py, `store fsck` in test_store_concurrency.py, and one docstring in test_fsck_push_pending.py.\n\nCI: patch set 1's run 39287305620 failed in 4 pytest cells, both causes above. Patch set 2's run 39512888801 has started; its result is not yet read. LLM-Review has no vote on patch set 2 (patch set 1's fail-closed -1 from the Bedrock cap is outdated).\n\nLocal make verify on patch set 1 (914beb80203, finished 2026-10-19 10:52 PDT, exit 2): 18 failed, 19,760 passed. The 18 are the 17 known pandoc failures (frenzied-snively-llama: test_wiki_render x13, test_rich_text_cutover x3, test_diff_comments_cutover_neutral x1) plus test_create_help_no_write_b8de, which patch set 2 fixes. Not re-run on patch set 2. make lint and make typecheck pass on patch set 2 (pre-commit hook). Unverified: the Linux integration tier (skipped in run 39287305620 because the default suite failed) and a full make verify on patch set 2.\n\nResume (Bedrock cap lifted):\n1. Read run 39512888801. If any cell fails, fix it, `git commit --amend --no-edit`, and re-push with `HEAD:refs/for/main%wip,hashtag=rebar-session-lane-e045`.\n2. `review_plan_start cubistic-patrician-deer`, then poll `plan_review_status` / `gate_status` to a signed PASS. On BLOCK, revise the description and re-review.\n3. `claim_ticket cubistic-patrician-deer` (no assignee, no force).\n4. Mark 3055 ready (`POST /a/changes/3055/ready`; no new patch set).\n5. Wait for LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 with no unresolved comments, then `scripts/gerrit_safe_submit.py 3055 --revision <current full sha>`.\n6. In the worktree: `git fetch origin && git merge --ff-only origin/main`. Set file impact to exactly the merged diff's files, reword the ACs to what was verified (allow the 17 pandoc failures), re-review, then `transition cubistic-patrician-deer in_progress closed`.\n7. Then story scabby-loverless-pipit: its plan is trimmed to release notes, CHANGELOG, the ADR at the next free number (0120 today) and api-stability. Drafts are in .rebar/scratch/lane-e045/draft-s3/ (apply_s3.py <n> <story2-merged-sha> <date>; dry run passed check_adr_numbers and gen_adr_index --check).\n8. Then story idling-amaranth-antelope: plan refreshed; draft test in .rebar/scratch/lane-e045/draft-s4/. Then close epic toadyish-sulfurous-ovenbird."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792537711088652001,"uuid":"00ac1a97-fe28-4daa-a6f9-ce2f4451f86b"}